{
  "version": 1,
  "_comment": "静态托管的共享规则:Worker 的包结构校验(app/api/_lib/hosting-bundle.ts)与盒子上的部署器(deploy/hosting/)都读取本文件;改动须同步更新两侧一致性向量测试。上限与 ClamAV 扫描器参数对齐(--max-files=500 --max-scansize=24M --max-filesize=10M --max-recursion=8),保证包内每个文件都被扫到。扩展名清单来自 StepFun 静态托管官方文档(platform.stepfun.com/docs/zh/guides/page-hosting)。 L6(2026-10 审计):svg 从 allowed/textScannable 移除——image/svg+xml 是可执行活动内容(脚本内嵌),托管域直接导航即执行;pdf 保留(被动文档,官方文档亦允许)。",
  "bundle": {
    "maxZipBytes": 10485760,
    "maxEntries": 500,
    "maxUncompressedBytes": 25165824,
    "maxFileBytes": 10485760,
    "maxCompressionRatio": 100,
    "maxPathLength": 200,
    "maxPathDepth": 8,
    "rootFile": "index.html"
  },
  "extensions": {
    "allowed": [
      "html",
      "htm",
      "css",
      "js",
      "mjs",
      "json",
      "map",
      "txt",
      "xml",
      "ico",
      "png",
      "jpg",
      "jpeg",
      "gif",
      "webp",
      "avif",
      "woff",
      "woff2",
      "ttf",
      "otf",
      "eot",
      "wasm",
      "pdf",
      "mp4",
      "webm",
      "mp3",
      "wav",
      "md",
      "markdown",
      "jsonl",
      "tsx",
      "jsx"
    ],
    "forbidden": [
      "php",
      "py",
      "exe",
      "sh",
      "bat",
      "cmd",
      "dll",
      "so",
      "jsp",
      "asp",
      "aspx",
      "cgi",
      "pl"
    ],
    "textScannable": [
      "html",
      "htm",
      "css",
      "js",
      "mjs",
      "json",
      "map",
      "txt",
      "xml",
      "md",
      "markdown",
      "jsonl",
      "tsx",
      "jsx"
    ]
  },
  "rejectedPathRules": [
    "任一路径段以 '.' 开头(含 .git、.env、.DS_Store、._*),一律拒绝",
    "路径段为 __MACOSX 或 node_modules,一律拒绝",
    "路径含反斜杠、控制字符、'..' 段、绝对路径(以 / 或盘符开头),一律拒绝",
    "同一路径(不区分大小写)出现两次,一律拒绝",
    "文件名(不含目录)匹配 id_rsa、id_ed25519、*.pem、*.key、*.p12、*.pfx,一律拒绝",
    "条目为目录以外的符号链接(zip external attrs 高 16 位 S_IFLNK),一律拒绝",
    "加密条目(general purpose flag bit0)、ZIP64、分卷压缩,一律拒绝"
  ],
  "secretPatterns": [
    {
      "id": "pem_private_key",
      "regex": "-----BEGIN (?:RSA |EC |DSA |OPENSSH |PGP |ENCRYPTED )?PRIVATE KEY(?: BLOCK)?-----",
      "flags": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "aws_access_key_id",
      "regex": "\\b(?:AKIA|ASIA)[0-9A-Z]{16}\\b",
      "flags": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "github_token",
      "regex": "\\bgh[pousr]_[A-Za-z0-9]{36,}\\b",
      "flags": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "github_fine_grained_token",
      "regex": "\\bgithub_pat_[A-Za-z0-9_]{50,}\\b",
      "flags": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "openai_style_secret_key",
      "regex": "\\bsk-(?:proj-|ant-)?[A-Za-z0-9_-]{32,}\\b",
      "flags": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "stripe_live_key",
      "regex": "\\b(?:sk|rk)_live_[A-Za-z0-9]{16,}\\b",
      "flags": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "slack_token",
      "regex": "\\bxox[abprs]-[A-Za-z0-9-]{10,}\\b",
      "flags": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "google_api_key",
      "regex": "\\bAIza[0-9A-Za-z_-]{35}\\b",
      "flags": ""
    }
  ],
  "provider": {
    "id": "stepfun_page",
    "liveHostSuffix": ".page.stepcloud.com",
    "previewHostSuffix": ".preview.stepcloud.com",
    "siteNameMaxLength": 64
  },
  "failureCodes": [
    "validation_bundle",
    "validation_secret",
    "provider_quota",
    "provider_audit_rejected",
    "provider_error",
    "provider_auth",
    "ambiguous",
    "bundle_missing",
    "internal"
  ]
}
